{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36257","headline":"初归镜中寄陈端公 · 方干","name":"初归镜中寄陈端公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去岁离家今岁归，孤帆梦向鸟前飞。\n必知芦笋侵沙井，兼被藤花占石矶。\n云岛采茶常失路，雪龛中酒不关扉。\n故交若问逍遥事，玄冕何曾胜苇衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36257.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36257","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}